							"id": "f51f869",
							"elType": "widget",
							"widgetType": "text-editor",
							"settings": {
								"editor": "<p>It is the electronic ticket for the railway that runs through Laos between Vientiane and the Chinese border at Boten, calling at stations including Vang Vieng and Luang Prabang. Tickets are issued against the passport of the traveller and presented at the station.</p>\n<p>This page explains the sequence — before you arrive, at the station, boarding, on board and on arrival — and the points where travellers most often run into trouble.</p>",
